Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: FemBoyGamerTechGuy <242450780+FemBoyGamerTechGuy@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: libdevel
Priority: optional
Version: @PKGVER@
Depends: libfdk-shell0 (= @PKGVER@), fdk-dev (>= @MINVER@)
Recommends: pkg-config
Homepage: https://github.com/Faded-Dream-Project/FDK
Description: Layer-shell surfaces for FDK — development files
 The fdk-shell public header and the pkg-config metadata
 (Requires: fdk) for developing panels, docks and overlays against
 fdk-shell. Compile with `pkg-config --cflags --libs fdk-shell`;
 the metadata carries the whole dependency chain.
 .
 The static archive is deliberately NOT shipped (FDK Proprietary
 License 4(d), the same posture as the fdk-dev package): build from
 source if you need it locally.
